# BCPS Lab 5 - Mail Merge

## Aim
To create personalized invitation letters using the Mail Merge feature in LibreOffice Writer.

## Software Used
LibreOffice Writer

## Procedure
1. Opened LibreOffice Writer.
2. Created an invitation letter.
3. Prepared a recipient list containing names and other details.
4. Connected the recipient list to the document using Mail Merge.
5. Inserted merge fields into the invitation letter.
6. Previewed the personalized letters.
7. Generated the merged documents.

## Result
Learned how to create personalized invitation letters for multiple recipients using the Mail Merge feature in LibreOffice Writer.
